                    {
                        "form_id": "cfbd23ce-bc8e-4244-9664-5be49d9c183d",
                        "entry_id": "73b46a5b-ff59-376f-8840-2fb1f4f19c6f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "скверносло́виях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                        "entry_id": "73b46a5b-ff59-376f-8840-2fb1f4f19c6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "речь, наполненная неприличными выражениями; непристойные слова, матерные ругательства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "229bf21b-d566-456e-94a5-edfdaf06cd1b",
                                "sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                                "text": "И можно себе представить, что я слышала: шум, крик, брань, питьё, сквернословие, даже драки бывали!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da30854b-0544-4759-8590-4d476151c2cf",
                                "sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                                "text": "Результатом труда вышла небольшая тетрадка, исполненная сквернословия."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5ab3b4d-3f61-4466-bf0a-bfca39cc5dca",
                                "sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                                "text": "Мы, русские, никаких уполномочий не имеем и потому заменяем их сквернословием. ❬…❭ По части сквернословия у русского человека собеседником может быть только такой же русский же человек."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6d95b1c-20d9-4543-b8b6-839ce6b8a929",
                                "sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                                "text": "Мы ещё не умеем бороться с засухами и наводнениями, где же одолеть могучую стихию сквернословия?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "326fbb8d-682d-4461-ba68-40aac4ba46f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "73b46a5b-ff59-376f-8840-2fb1f4f19c6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebc71d62-4582-3242-b874-35db858c975b",
                        "target_lang_word": "ribaldry",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ribaldry",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bd85ef0-3331-3035-9a42-6a4b57d61a53",
                                        "entry_id": "8050eb49-0a0d-3dcf-8b61-9193b9542031",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Joking or humorous language or behaviour used in a vulgar or lewd fashion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cea87fcc-3ecb-4e96-b105-5773d5ea6675",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd85ef0-3331-3035-9a42-6a4b57d61a53",
                                                "text": "Playes are the nurseries of vice, the bawd, / That thorow the senses steales our hearts abroad, / Tainting our eares with obscæne bawdery, / Lascivious words, and wanton ribaulry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "460ff619-bd0e-4243-b38c-0f2c60c09457",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd85ef0-3331-3035-9a42-6a4b57d61a53",
                                                "text": "His jargon of slang was a continuous joy and surprise to them. His gestures, his strange poses, his frank ribaldry of tongue and principle fascinated them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "421d2ed5-ce38-4c11-a11e-bc8fc629de55",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd85ef0-3331-3035-9a42-6a4b57d61a53",
                                                "text": "Sometimes these sagas and anecdotes are touched with ribaldry, or with excessive obscenity, according to the times, and sometimes they are rooted in obscure but still verifiable deistic concepts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd9180f8-dd7a-4e06-bd4a-c6a7d0cf8864",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd85ef0-3331-3035-9a42-6a4b57d61a53",
                                                "text": "I remember girls with men's muscles flinging fish baskets while they yelled ribaldries at each other, and fishermen strutting among them in their oilskins, too grand to be bothered with anyone but themselves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
